        {
          "text": "Te anzi Israelini ka wu Yehova vu ra, Yehova fe ’ba ’ba papiri enga anzi Israelini dri yi opazu, eri Otinieli, Kalebu ma adripi eri vutia Kenazi’iri ma mvi’i. ",
